@startuml
title CCL-08 - UML sequence: claim lineage and multi-format report
skinparam shadowing false
participant "Workflow Runtime" as Runtime
participant "Report Service" as Report
database "Run / Node Repository" as RunRepo
database "Evidence Repository" as EvidenceRepo
participant "Lineage Builder" as Lineage
participant "Artifact Renderer" as Renderer
collections "Artifact Store" as Store
participant "Reports UI" as UI
Runtime -> Report : buildReport(runId, terminalNodeStates)
Report -> RunRepo : load run, version, configuration, role outputs
RunRepo --> Report : immutable run context + executed role set
Report -> EvidenceRepo : load normalized evidence and provider metadata
EvidenceRepo --> Report : evidence IDs, times, currency, hashes
Report -> Lineage : link claims -> node outputs -> evidence -> providers
loop every material claim
  Lineage -> Lineage : resolve evidence refs and content hashes
  alt reference found
    Lineage -> Lineage : mark supported
  else missing reference
    Lineage -> Lineage : mark unsupported and add warning
  end
end
Lineage --> Report : lineage graph + completeness
Report -> Renderer : one typed report model
par JSON
  Renderer -> Renderer : serialize canonical JSON
else HTML
  Renderer -> Renderer : render readable HTML
else PDF
  Renderer -> Renderer : render report PDF
end
Renderer -> Store : write artifacts and SHA-256 hashes
Store --> Report : artifact metadata
Report -> RunRepo : persist report, claims, lineage, artifacts
UI -> Report : get owned report/history/lineage/export
Report --> UI : same report model and selected artifact
@enduml
